From d81564d837fda7d6a54f2fd41b6edaa3f9c8fc38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Cosi <contact@gabrielcosi.dev>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 11:29:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] server: choose the diarizer geometry per request

POST /v1/audio/diarizations takes an optional geometry field, streaming
or offline, resolved for the loaded model's version. A client can
diarize a whole recording with the long-chunk geometry while the
realtime stream keeps the server's low-latency one: on a 43-minute
recording with a V3 model, 4.8 s instead of 81 s.
---
